            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9006P/440, Modern Refrigerator Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt's not something you think about often, but refrigerator pulls, when extrodinary, can really make you stop and take notice. The Modern Appliance Pull by Omnia is perfect for completing a kitchen's aesthetic--the finishing touch that says that you have an eye for detail and style. The sleekness of Omnia's 9006P/440 Appliance Pull allows it to look great in almost any décor. It measures 17-15/16\" long and only 1\" thick for contemporary appeal. It is constructed out of solid brass and is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil-rubbed bronze finishes. Since this simple pull is so easy to clean it will maintain a smooth, rich luster for the lifetime of your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: <a href=\"/products/modern-cabinet-pull-omnia-9006\"><b>Matching \"C\" Shaped Cabinet Door Pull</b></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length (center to center): 17-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting hardware: 1/4-20 bolt</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
